{"meta":{"description":"Learn about the Sip and Savor Pass and sample delicious food and delightful beverages during select festivals at the Disneyland Resort in California.","keywords":"DLR, Disney, Disneyland Resort, food and wine, food and wine festival, disney food and wine festival, Lunar New Year, Disney California Adventure Park, Mulan's Lunar New Year Procession, Hurry Home, Sonoma Terrace, Paradise Garden Bandstand, Sip and Savor Pass, Disney Characters, Mickey Mouse, Minnie Mouse, Mulan, Mushu, Paradise Garden grill, Redwood Creek Challenge Trail, Raya, Lucky Wishes Wall","title":"Sip and Savor Pass | Disneyland Resort"},"id":"19436152;entityType=restaurant","theme":"hyperion","entityTypeUrl":"/dining/#/","type":"restaurant","contentService":"explorer","themeData":{"finder":"hyperion"},"aagData":{"type":"restaurant","title":"Sip and Savor Pass","location":"Disney California Adventure Park","admissionRequired":{"title":"Valid Ticket and Park Reservation for Same Park on Same Date Required"},"description":"Embark on an amazing epicurean adventure full of flavor and fun with this special pass that you can use at many of the Disneyland Resort events and festivals! Check back for upcoming celebrations.","media":{"desktop":"https://cdn1.parksmedia.wdprapps.disney.com/resize/mwImage/1/1600/900/75/vision-dam/digital/parks-platform/parks-global-assets/disneyland/events/food-and-wine-festival/dining/Food_Wine_2026_Sip_Savor_DSC_8961-16x9.jpg?2026-02-18T17:41:08+00:00","mobile":"https://cdn1.parksmedia.wdprapps.disney.com/resize/mwImage/1/630/354/75/vision-dam/digital/parks-platform/parks-global-assets/disneyland/events/food-and-wine-festival/dining/Food_Wine_2026_Sip_Savor_DSC_8961-16x9.jpg?2026-02-18T17:41:08+00:00","media":"(max-width: 768px)","alt":"A Guest holding 2 Sip and Savor Passes at Disney California Adventure Food & Wine Festival 2026"},"breadcrumb":{"template":"Multiple {link} locations","data":[{"label":"Disneyland Resort"}]},"facetGroups":[{"name":"cuisine","icon":"dining","facets":[{"name":"Vegetarian","urlFriendlyId":"vegetarian-cuisine","url":"/dining/#/vegetarian-cuisine","isClickable":false},{"name":"Californian","urlFriendlyId":"californian-cuisine","url":"/dining/#/californian-cuisine","isClickable":false},{"name":"Quick Service","urlFriendlyId":"quick-service","url":"/dining/#/quick-service","isClickable":false}]}],"discountsModal":{"prefix":"finder.discountsModal","deepLinks":{"diningPlan":"dining-plans","annualPass":"magic-key","disneyVisa":"disney-visa","dvc":"disney-vacation-club"},"sectionIcons":{"name":{"opened":"norgie-opened","closed":"norgie-closed"}},"sections":{}},"calendar":{"maxDays":42,"checkAvailabilityMaxDays":60,"maxAdditionalDays":10,"ctParkHoursMaxDays":42,"getMaxCalDaysFromService":false},"menuLink":{"text":"View Menu","href":"/dining/disney-california-adventure/sip-and-savor/menus/"},"actionButtonText":"","mealPeriodsData":{"labels":{"title":"Meal Periods","toLabel":"to","noSchedules":"There are no schedules available for the date selected.","defaultErrorMessage":"We were unable to check for available tables at this time. A problem occurred while looking for availability. Please try again later."}},"labels":{"waitTime":"finder.listing.dashPublic.waitTime"},"backgroundGradient":{"upperLeft":"#FFFAEB","lowerRight":"#F3FDFF"}},"storycards":{"data":[{"sections":[{"copy":["<p>Delight in an array of tasty menu options with a Sip and Savor Pass! Available for a separate fee, this pass is a scannable credential that includes a specified number of digital coupons, which can be redeemed for a select food item or nonalcoholic beverage at festival marketplaces or participating dining locations at Disney California Adventure Park during a designated event or festival.</p><p>Stay tuned for exciting details about upcoming festivities where you can use this pass!</p>"],"key":"entityCard1","title":"Taste Your Way Through an Event or Festival"},{"copy":["<ul><li>Valid Magic Key pass and photo ID must be shown upon purchase of the Sip and Savor Pass to receive the special price and lanyard.</li><li>One digital coupon may be redeemed for one eligible food or nonalcoholic beverage item at a participating Festival Marketplace or dining location. Excludes souvenir items. Applicable taxes included. Only one Sip and Savor Pass can be used in a single transaction. No photocopies or reproductions will be accepted.</li><li>To redeem a digital coupon, present the Sip and Savor Pass to a Cast Member at a participating Festival Marketplace or dining location. Then, enter the 4-digit code located on the pass at checkout. The remaining number of digital coupons on the pass will be printed on the receipt. You may also ask a Cast Member at any Festival Marketplace to scan the Sip and Savor Pass to confirm the number of digital coupons remaining on the pass.</li><li>Eligible Sip and Savor Pass items at participating restaurants are tasting-size portions only, not full entrée offerings.</li><li>Sip and Savor Passes and digital coupons will not be replaced if lost, stolen, damaged or expired. Sip and Savor Passes and digital coupons are nonrefundable, nontransferable and may not be redeemed for cash, in whole or in part, and are void if sold or transferred for a commercial purpose. No substitutions or change will be given.</li><li>Valid admission and park reservation for Disney California Adventure Park required.</li><li>Sip and Savor Pass, its entitlements, food and beverage offerings, participating marketplace locations and participating dining locations are all subject to availability, restrictions and change or cancellation without notice. Other restrictions may apply.</li></ul>"],"key":"entityCard2","title":"Important Information"}]}]},"learnMore":[],"relatedActivities":{"title":"Related Activities","data":[]},"map":{"title":"Location","linkText":"Go to Map","location":{"defaults":{"center":{"lat":33.811,"lng":-117.922},"zoom":17,"tileLayerOptions":{"maxZoom":20,"minZoom":14,"